# The patrolling beetle. 28x32, drawn 1:1 like the hero.
#
# accent-rust is its shell, which is the one place in the game that colour
# appears at any size — STYLE.md rations it to the hero's baldric strap
# otherwise. A hazard the player must not touch is exactly what an accent is
# for, and nothing else on screen competes for it.
#
# Wide and low so the silhouette never reads as a second person.
name platformer-enemy
size 28 32
key o outline
key R warm-0-shadow
key r accent-rust
key W warm-2-mid
key L warm-5-hilite
key y warm-4
pixels
